Z||000006||FieroMontreal||11-11-2001||12:43 AM||||TN Fiero. You are right, I was wrong.. when I looked the first time not all the pics showed up.. but now that I got to see them all I think that it IS prob an Indy with a coupe nose.. to many factors pointing towards it..<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif"> <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>-Alex President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Oreif||11-11-2001||01:14 AM||||All Indy Pace cars are VIN'd as SE's. I ran the VIN and it does come up as an SE. The interior is correct for an Indy. I would guess the nose was changed sometime in it's life. The engine has the correct valve cover and Air cleaner markings. (usually one of the things "fake" Indy's don't have) Also the VIN number is higher than the first Indy VIN number. My bet would be it is an original Indy. Looks like a good restoration base to start from. ||||reg||1
Z||000008||Indy-2M4||11-11-2001||10:22 AM||||Everything is correct except for the nose. Would be a "well worth it" project car. It would be nice if the VINs could have been coded somewhere to specify Indy and get the production number.<P>------------------<BR><BR>F.K.A. KathyHL<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://sofa.iwarp.com/IndyFiero2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||jimmybpei||11-11-2001||02:53 PM||||No expert on the indy topic, but i do have one, 84 4 speed even more rare than the one they are sellin. Anyway it looks as though the car was in an accicdent at on time because of the nosecone, this is not the correct one as weel most of the badgeing is there except for the fade strip that separatesthe silver and the white. dosnt have the pontiac in the winshield or the door stickers. ithinkd that these had to be purchased at the time of vehicle purchase.<P>I do have these on my car as well as an extra set(just in case)<P>The car should also have different painted on markings on the silver valve cover and air filter cover. the interior should have red carpet and red and grey leather seats with the indy logo stamped on the seats.<P>Hope this helps out <BR>Later <BR>Jimmy B.<BR>||||reg||1
